.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK AGENT VALIDATE"
.SH NAME
hamstik agent validate \- Validate the local agent harness offline: installed skill metadata against the running CLI version, credential\-shaped content in the config directory (reported without displaying values), and bundled OpenAPI snapshot freshness when online. Also available as `agent doctor`
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik agent validate [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate the local agent harness offline: installed skill metadata against the running CLI version, credential\-shaped content in the config directory (reported without displaying values), and bundled OpenAPI snapshot freshness when online. Also available as `agent doctor`
.SH ALIASES
doctor
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I PATH
Explicit path to a `SKILL.md` to validate instead of the default installed-location lookup
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --offline
Skip the live OpenAPI snapshot-freshness comparison and make no network requests
Choices: true, false
